1600 GOSUB 6320:BM$="Greg: Here we are, Jeffs. You pretend to be a simple fortune teller, but we\know you're a sorcerer at the service of the northern tribes. How about\you do yourself a favor and answer our questions honestly?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
